#. module: l10n_ca_bc_payroll
#: model:l10n_ca.payroll.source,summary:l10n_ca_bc_payroll.source_bc_tax_rates
msgid ""
"2026 brackets with the lowest rate of 5.60% (Budget 2026); indexation of the"
" brackets paused for the 2027 to 2030 tax years."
msgstr ""
"Tranches de 2026 avec le taux le plus bas de 5,60 % (budget 2026) ; "
"indexation des tranches suspendue pour les années d'imposition 2027 à 2030."

#. module: l10n_ca_bc_payroll
#: model:l10n_ca.payroll.source,name:l10n_ca_bc_payroll.source_worksafebc_rates_2027
msgid "2027 Premium Rates"
msgstr "Taux de prime de 2027"

#. module: l10n_ca_bc_payroll
#: model:l10n_ca.payroll.source,summary:l10n_ca_bc_payroll.source_eht_associated
msgid ""
"Associated employers whose combined British Columbia remuneration is more "
"than 1,000,000 and at most 1,500,000 share the exemption of 1,000,000 by an "
"allocation agreement; above 1,500,000 none of them has an exemption."
msgstr ""
"Les employeurs associés dont la rémunération combinée en Colombie-"
"Britannique dépasse 1 000 000 sans excéder 1 500 000 se partagent "
"l'exemption de 1 000 000 par une convention de répartition ; au-delà de 1 "
"500 000, aucun d'eux n'a d'exemption."

#. module: l10n_ca_bc_payroll
#: model:l10n_ca.payroll.source,summary:l10n_ca_bc_payroll.source_bc_tax_credits
msgid ""
"Basic personal amount of 13,216 for 2026; indexation of the basic personal "
"tax credits paused for 2027 to 2030. B.C. tax reduction credit of 690 for "
"2026 to 2030 (Budget 2026), net income threshold 25,570, reduction factor "
"3.56%, maximum net income 44,952, indexation paused for 2027 to 2030."
msgstr ""
"Montant personnel de base de 13 216 pour 2026 ; indexation des crédits "
"d'impôt personnels de base suspendue de 2027 à 2030. Crédit de réduction "
"d'impôt de la C.-B. de 690 pour 2026 à 2030 (budget 2026), seuil de revenu "
"net de 25 570, facteur de réduction de 3,56 %, revenu net maximum de 44 952,"
" indexation suspendue de 2027 à 2030."

#. module: l10n_ca_bc_payroll
#: model:l10n_ca.payroll.source,summary:l10n_ca_bc_payroll.source_workers_compensation_act
msgid ""
"Before the end of each calendar year, WorkSafeBC determines the maximum wage"
" rate of the following year, which may be rounded to the nearest 100."
msgstr ""
"Avant la fin de chaque année civile, WorkSafeBC fixe le taux de salaire "
"maximum de l'année suivante, qui peut être arrondi à la centaine la plus "
"proche."

#. module: l10n_ca_bc_payroll
#: model:l10n_ca.payroll.source,name:l10n_ca_bc_payroll.source_bc_tax_credits
msgid "British Columbia Basic Tax Credits"
msgstr "Crédits d'impôt de base de la Colombie-Britannique"

