#: model:l10n_ca.payroll.source,summary:l10n_ca_bc_payroll.source_td1bc_2026
msgid ""
"British Columbia basic personal amount of 13,216 for 2026 and the total "
"claim amount TCP entered on the contract."
msgstr ""
"Montant personnel de base de la Colombie-Britannique de 13 216 pour 2026 et "
"le montant total de la demande TCP saisi au contrat."

#. module: l10n_ca_bc_payroll
#: model:l10n_ca.payroll.source,summary:l10n_ca_bc_payroll.source_t4127_122
msgid ""
"British Columbia rates 5.06%, 7.70%, 10.50%, 12.29%, 14.70%, 16.80% and "
"20.50% from 50,363, 100,728, 115,648, 140,430, 190,405 and 265,545; basic "
"personal amount 13,216; BC tax reduction S2 of 575, reduced by 3.56% of A "
"above 25,570, nil above 41,722."
msgstr ""
"Taux de la Colombie-Britannique de 5,06 %, 7,70 %, 10,50 %, 12,29 %, 14,70 "
"%, 16,80 % et 20,50 % à partir de 50 363, 100 728, 115 648, 140 430, 190 405"
" et 265 545 ; montant personnel de base de 13 216 ; réduction d'impôt de la "
"C.-B. S2 de 575, diminuée de 3,56 % de A au-delà de 25 570, nulle au-delà de"
" 41 722."

